YOLO (You Only Look Once) – The AI That Sees Everything in a Blink!

Imagine you're standing in front of a busy CCTV monitor.

A normal human security guard needs to carefully watch:

👨 People entering the building
🚗 Cars entering the parking lot
🏍️ Bikes moving around
📦 Suspicious objects left behind

Watching all of this 24/7 is almost impossible.

Enter YOLO 👀⚡

YOLO (You Only Look Once) is a powerful Deep Learning model that can instantly detect multiple objects in an image or video.

Unlike older models that look at an image many times, YOLO looks only once and immediately says:

I found:
✓ 3 People
✓ 2 Cars
✓ 1 Bike
✓ 1 Dog

All within milliseconds!

